 Write Program to Load, Clean and Exploring the data using python.

ALGORITHM:
Load, Clean and Explore Data using Python


Start the program.


Import the Pandas library.


Create a dataset using a dictionary.


Load the dataset into a Pandas DataFrame.


Display the original dataset.


Check for missing values using isnull().


Clean the data by removing missing values using dropna().


Display the cleaned dataset.


Explore the dataset by:


Displaying first few rows using head()


Displaying column names


Displaying dataset information using info()


Displaying statistical summary using describe()


CODE:

import pandas as pd


data = {
    "Name": ["Arun", "Bhavana", "Charan", "Divya", None],
    "Age": [21, 22, None, 20, 23],
    "Marks": [85, 90, 78, None, 88],
    "City": ["Mysuru", "Bengaluru", "Mangaluru", "Hubli", None]
}

df = pd.DataFrame(data)

print("ORIGINAL DATA")
print(df)

# ---------------- DATA CLEANING ----------------

print("\nMISSING VALUES")
print(df.isnull())

cleaned_df = df.dropna()


print("\nCLEANED DATA")
print(cleaned_df)

# ---------------- DATA EXPLORATION ----------------

print("\nFIRST 3 ROWS")
print(cleaned_df.head(3))


print("\nCOLUMN NAMES")
print(cleaned_df.columns)


print("\nDATASET INFORMATION")
print(cleaned_df.info())


print("\nSTATISTICAL SUMMARY")
print(cleaned_df.describe())

